        "body": "Chegg describes itself as a provider of 24/7 homework help and study support across 50+ subjects. Its website says it offers relevant study solutions, step-by-step support, and access to real experts, and that it is committed to high-quality solutions enhanced by student feedback. The site also mentions Chegg Study and Chegg Study Pack subscriptions, which include additional benefits at no cost to subscribers.\n\nThe company's AI product is CheggMate, a study AI assistant. Notes associated with CheggMate mention academic help, student data, content accuracy, and honor code implications.\n\nChegg is a for-profit public company, ticker CHGG, with SEC Central Index Key 0001364954. It was founded in 2005 and is headquartered in Santa Clara.",
